    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.08,
      515.28,
      481.98,
      525.35
    ],
    "text": "1. These Regulations may be cited as Control of Pesticides Regulations (Time Limits) 01 st of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.08,
      539.28,
      562.8,
      549.35
    ],
    "text": "2. The time limit between the use of pesticides, specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto on the food crop specified in",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.04,
      551.28,
      563.15,
      573.35
    ],
    "text": "the corresponding entry in Column II of the Schedule and the harvest of that food crop shall be as specified in thecorresponding entry in Column III of the Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.08,
      587.28,
      563.14,
      597.35
    ],
    "text": "3. Where any such crop contains any residue of a pesticide such residue shall not exceed the level specified in the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.04,
      599.28,
      302.63,
      609.35
    ],
    "text": "corresponding entry in Column IV of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.08,
      623.28,
      521.57,
      633.35
    ],
    "text": "4. The regulations published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 433/3 of December 24, 1986 are hereby rescinded.",
